c:32](src/cljc/dao/star_cart/view.cljc#L32), [view.cljc:64](src/cljc/dao/star_cart/view.cljc#L64); coverage: [fixes_test.clj:127](test/dao/star_cart/fixes_test.clj#L127).\n\n7. **RESOLVED — Default persistence.** CLI startup supplies `target/cart-catalog.edn`; writes create parents; pathless stores log “MEMORY ONLY”; README documents behavior. [main.clj:74](src/clj/dao/star_cart/main.clj#L74); [store.clj:37](src/clj/dao/star_cart/store.clj#L37); [store.clj:62](src/clj/dao/star_cart/store.clj#L62); [README.md:26](resources/dao_star_cart/README.md#L26).\n\n**Additional finding — LOW:** Duplicate-image validation still accepts filesystem aliases. `/images/7..png` and `/images/./7..png` resolve to the same existing file, but validation retains distinct strings and duplicate detection compares those strings. Normalize or reject dot-segment and repeated-separator aliases before storage and comparison. [edge.clj:43](src/clj/dao/star_cart/edge.clj#L43); [grid_effects.clj:62](src/clj/dao/star_cart/grid_effects.clj#L62); [grid_effects.clj:98](src/clj/dao/star_cart/grid_effects.clj#L98).\n\nSupplied test and deployment results remain external evidence; no further material interactions found statically.\n\nVerdict: SIGNED OFF WITH CHANGES"}}
